OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for drugging then      
OL,4,Aabusing girlfriend                     
OL,6,FA "depraved" offender who repeatedly   
OL,7,Ffilmed himself sexually abusing his    
OL,8,Funconscious partner after giving her   
OL,9,Fsleeping tablets has been jailed.      
OL,11,FThe man, in his 30s, who the BBC is not
OL,12,Fnaming in order to protect the identity
OL,13,Fof his victim, had been giving his     
OL,14,Fpartner sleeping pills in order to     
OL,15,Fassault her over the course of 13      
OL,16,Fmonths, abuse which on a number of     
OL,17,Foccasions he filmed and shared online. 
